            "sid": "1KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Aymaro tawa hhe'eés, aakooduú aarusmo daqwaay gway amohhe'eés as heedaáduú Mungú, iri tláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár iwa tláy, iwa baraá loohi, nee diraangw tiri doogiyé'. Kuri óh nee diraangw, kuri gaás, kuri kwaáhh baraá loohi, daqwaay nee dirangwdá' ta sihhimiit bihhaá tuuaadá' wa aleeró. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk aa didár waraahh tuua gari ár, kaa kwaáhh baraá loohi, diraangw i bihhaadá' wa sihhimiit. Inooín tari hardáh baraá gixsadá' aakooduú aarusmo i hooti, kaangwí kuri dirós i oó'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár aakooduú aarusmo oo heeduú Mungú gwa amór do'ósí ki/is kangwdá' nguwa axaás, iri oó', «Heesíng a heedaáduú Mungú oo axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gaa iialooeesiiká, gawaá adoorihe, Mungú guna diraángwí tleés as nguwa oohi, guri feehhamiís ar adoodá' axweesantá Mungú ngwaa beér.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daaqaywós guri báy, «Daqwaay amohhe'esare'.» Inooín daqwaay ngway amohhe'eesiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aakoodá' iri tláy, tuuaadár heé Mungú gari baraá loohírí áy, diraangw nee daqwaywós i bihhaawós wa sihhimiitiya'. Diraangw tuuaadá' gaa /ayiiká tam daqwaydá' gwaa oohiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy aakooduú aarusmo tuuaadár heé Mungú gari tsa/aás gawaá daanduú daqwaywós, gari ar kií/ ay gixsár Beteli, as kuwa satsuunqumisi, kway foól. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós tuuaadár heeduú Mungú gari foól baraá /aantaarós, inós nee daaqaywós ngway satsuunqumisiyé' tawa kaahi, «Ooyeé! Hhiyaaeé'!» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá heeduú Mungú foolaro kuwa hhe'eés, aarusmoodá' daaqaywós guri báy, «Aníng bara gwaá', foolaré' baraá /aantaarír kilá' heé Mungú kway foolaán, faduueé' bihhaá faduuwós ti qase'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma axweesantadá' sleémeero aa káh ar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa oó', daanduú kitangwduú ilahhooa oo Beteli nee maraá taa tleéhh baraá gongoamaá Samaria, ar looeemaawo tí i bó/.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
